      "role": "user",
      "content": "acetazolamide and pilocarpine? i haven't heard of those, are they safe to just pick up? i'd rather just take a high dose of some regular drops to get it cleared up fast so i can focus on my project. how many drops should i use to make sure it works? also is it okay if i take some ibuprofen with them for the pressure?",
